KPL/PCK

The file pck00011.tpc has only Jupiter System III rotation. This tracks the magnetic field.
For rendering, it is most often useful to use System II as it is designed to track the
Great Red Spot. This kernel gives the rotation model for System II only, and must be used
along with pck00011.tpc for a complete orientation model of Jupiter. Values are from the
IAU 2015 report.

#furnsh "pck00011.tpc"
#furnsh "jupiter_system2.tpc"


System I
        BODY599_PM             = (    67.1        877.900      0. )
System II
        BODY599_PM             = (    43.3        870.270      0. )
System III (from pck00011.tpc)
        BODY599_PM             = (   284.95        870.5360000      0. )


\begindata
        BODY599_PM             = (    43.3        870.270      0. )
